      "alt": "TQMa335x Embedded module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on Cortex®-A8 (AM335x) with graphics and real-time support.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa335x is an embedded module based on Cortex®-A8 (AM335x) with graphics and real-time support. It offers a real-time communication subsystem and low power consumption (typ. 2 W), making it suitable for energy-efficient applications. With 2x IEEE1588 Ethernet (L2 Switch) and long-term availability, it ensures reliable connectivity and longevity in use. The module, with a basis of an ARM® Cortex®-A8 core running up to 1 GHz, is designed for high-volume projects, making it cost-effective and efficient for visualization and control tasks with real-time requirements. It boasts a wide range of communication interfaces and functions, simplifying baseboard development.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:14:21 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
